data: {"id": "ac3617bf3563497e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1470", "run_id": "ac3617bf3563497e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`workload` 在 `aiops-case-v02` 中状态为 **Pending**，`node: <none>`，未分配到任何节点。\n2. **调度器事件（FailedScheduling）**：\n   - 52m 前和 11m 前（8 次累计）均收到 `default-scheduler` 的 `Warning FailedScheduling`。\n   - 原文：\"**0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory**.\" 预检查：3 个节点都因内存不足被拒绝，且无预emption 受害者。\n3. **Pod 资源需求 vs 限制**：\n   - Requests: cpu=5m, memory=未显式声明（仅 Limits 有 memory=1Pi）。\n   - Limits: cpu=50m, **memory=1Pi**。\n4. **PromQL 指标**：`kube_pod_status_phase` 确认当前 phase=Pending，无 Running/Succ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789112249166, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

